1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,000
You're a 25-year-old reporter in 1899.

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,280
Now you're an escaped prisoner,

3
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:07,760
worth 25 pounds, dead or alive.

4
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,060
Where do you hide?

5
00:00:09,479 --> 00:00:13,009
November 15, 1899. South Africa.

6
00:00:13,599 --> 00:00:15,359
Winston Churchill is a war correspondent

7
00:00:15,359 --> 00:00:16,609
for the Morning Post,

8
00:00:16,859 --> 00:00:19,151
riding an armoured train near Chieveley.

9
00:00:19,221 --> 00:00:20,771
Boer guns derail it.

10
00:00:21,001 --> 00:00:22,021
He helps clear the line,

11
00:00:22,021 --> 00:00:23,861
under fire. Then he's surrounded,

12
00:00:23,861 --> 00:00:24,791
and taken prisoner.

13
00:00:25,274 --> 00:00:27,244
They lock him in a school in Pretoria,

14
00:00:27,574 --> 00:00:29,624
turned into a prison for British officers.

15
00:00:30,091 --> 00:00:31,981
December 12. At night,

16
00:00:32,071 --> 00:00:33,651
he climbs the wall by the latrine,

17
00:00:33,651 --> 00:00:35,221
and walks out through the town.

18
00:00:35,612 --> 00:00:37,162
The Boers put a price on him.

19
00:00:37,392 --> 00:00:39,482
25 pounds, dead or alive.

20
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:41,431
He jumps a goods train in the dark,

21
00:00:41,431 --> 00:00:43,001
and ends up at a coal mine.

22
00:00:43,551 --> 00:00:45,341
By luck, the manager is English.

23
00:00:46,111 --> 00:00:47,871
John Howard hides him at the bottom of the

24
00:00:47,871 --> 00:00:48,241
mine.

25
00:00:48,542 --> 00:00:50,452
Then he's smuggled out in a freight car,

26
00:00:50,762 --> 00:00:51,962
buried under bales of wool,

27
00:00:51,962 --> 00:00:55,512
almost 300 miles, to Portuguese East Africa.

28
00:00:56,042 --> 00:00:56,312
Free.

29
00:00:56,724 --> 00:00:58,724
Britain had just lost three battles in one

30
00:00:58,724 --> 00:01:00,554
week. Now it had a hero.

31
00:01:01,024 --> 00:01:01,974
Less than a year later,

32
00:01:02,004 --> 00:01:02,694
he was in Parliament.

33
00:01:03,228 --> 00:01:06,028
Four decades later, the man worth 25 pounds

34
00:01:06,028 --> 00:01:08,368
became Prime Minister. Would you have turned

35
00:01:08,368 --> 00:01:09,828
him in? Tell me below,

36
00:01:09,828 --> 00:01:11,738
and follow Buried Chronicles.

